  "key": "PSAPAC-523",
  "fields": {
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "attrs": {
            "isNumberColumnEnabled": false,
            "layout": "default",
            "localId": "0bdc66b3-59d8-4ccc-9eaf-6204be3f10aa"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Current situation"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Customer questions: "
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "1. Can you formally confirm that the Collibra GCP connector is architected to only use the bigquery.tables.getData permission for the specific purpose of resolving view schemas via metadata queries (e.g., LIMIT 0), and will not use it to read or ingest the actual contents of tables? Is this specific behavior and the need for this permission detailed in your public documentation or a knowledge base article? A direct link would be extremely valuable for our internal audit trail."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "orderedList",
                      "attrs": {
                        "order": 2
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Is your team exploring any alternatives or working with Google on a more granular permission for this task in the future? Understanding the long-term plan here would be beneficial."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "orderedList",
                      "attrs": {
                        "order": 3
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Do you provide any best practices for customers to monitor the activity of the Collibra service account in GCP? For example, do you recommend specific audit log alerts to ensure the account is operating as expected?"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Steps already taken"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "How can product help?"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A customer is experiencing an issue with BigQuery lineage because their security and GCP teams will not grant the bigquery.tables.getData permission. They are asking our product team for a detailed explanation to justify this requirement."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Specifically, they need to know:"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "bulletList",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Why this exact permission is necessary."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "How to mitigate any potential security risks."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "How to monitor the service account to ensure it does not extract data."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "listItem",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "paragraph",
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "How they can convince their security team that this is the correct permission and is safe to grant."
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
